data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","item_id":"rs_0012c6fea44435d1016acc4086dd648193bd5cf32cb334a7d7","output_index":0,"sequence_number":80,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Assessing test integration**\n\nI'm trying to figure out if my time budget is enough to create a test that integrates with the legacy system and moves through all the filters. It's definitely challenging to balance everything, but it feels important to make sure the test runs smoothly. I wonder if I need to adjust my plans or prioritize certain aspects to make sure I can complete everything effectively. Let's see what I can manage!"}

